# Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!.tfvars.example
# Entradas NAO secretas do portal (ARNs, subnets, client publico, IPs de endpoint). Se
# `portal` voltar a ser null num apply, o Terraform destroi task definition/roles/SG/NLB do
# portal — por isso estes valores precisam viver no repo, nao no terminal de quem aplicou.
# A DSN continua so' no Secrets Manager. Ver deploy/aws-ecs/envs/dev-sa-east-1/portal.md.
!deploy/aws-ecs/envs/dev-sa-east-1/portal.auto.tfvars
!deploy/aws-ecs/envs/dev-sa-east-1/retomada.auto.tfvars
!deploy/aws-ecs/envs/dev-sa-east-1/lucas.auto.tfvars
!deploy/aws-ecs/envs/dev-sa-east-1/amh-interop.auto.tfvars

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
dist/
.venv/
# uv.lock NAO e ignorado: o lockfile fica versionado e e consumido em CI pelo
# osv-scanner (security.yml: `--lockfile=uv.lock`, varredura de supply-chain a cada trigger).
# Regra de ignorar foi removida em 05/10/2026 — auditar em docs/audits/REPO-SYNC-LEAK-AUDIT-2026-10.md.

# Test / coverage artifacts
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/

# Docker
.env

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Runtime artifacts
SESSION.log
RUNBOOK.md
CHECKPOINT.md
.worktrees/

# Local-only orchestration docs (excluded from GitHub per owner decision 2026-07-19).
# Kept on the working tree only; the rest of docs/ (evidence-ledger.md, adr/, decisions-log.md,
# contracts, compliance, gates, design, sme-dispatch) stays tracked + on GitHub + CI-readable.
docs/prompts/
docs/audits/

# Orchestrator machine-state handoff — deliberately local-only, never enters the repo (rewritten
# every session; see MEMORY.md orchestrator-operating-model / v2-execution-state notes).
/handoff.yaml

# Lock de execucao do engine local (PID, pgids, token de sessao, paths locais) escrito por
# sessoes concorrentes do projeto maezo-completion-engine. Estado de maquina efemero —
# local-only, mesmo tratamento de /handoff.yaml.
/engine.lock/

# Owner's private working file — not for GitHub/CI (docs/reports/ itself stays tracked; only this
# one file is excluded).
docs/reports/amh-integration-forensics-summary.md

# Plano de execucao do Terraform: pode conter valores resolvidos (endpoints, ARNs)
# e nao deve viajar no repositorio.
*.tfplan

# Agent-session working outputs — engagement deliverables produced by local agent runs from this
# cwd, NOT platform source (verified unrelated to maezo code 2026-08-24: self-contained regulatory-
# analysis bundle, ~421 MB of downloaded public sources + rendered artifacts + agent-run state).
# Local-only by design; never `git add` wholesale.
/outputs/

# Claude Code ephemera: session worktrees (branch refs live in the main .git) and the
# per-user local settings override that must never carry credentials into the repo.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Pasta de trabalho local: documentos que o dono deixa aqui para eu ler (especificacoes do
# diretor, arquivos recuperados do ECR, transcricoes de bateria). NAO E DO REPOSITORIO — entrou
# por engano num `git add -A` em 17/09/2026 e trouxe junto tres alertas de path injection do
# CodeQL sobre uma copia antiga do canal de teste. Ignorada para o engano nao se repetir.
temp/
